1
00:00:04,648 --> 00:00:07,168
Part of what makes life
between spouses
beautiful is …

2
00:00:08,264 --> 00:00:13,256
that the husband,
when he sees in his wife
zeal for something good
and beneficial, …

3
00:00:13,256 --> 00:00:15,358
encourages her in it

4
00:00:16,488 --> 00:00:20,520
and shows her
that there is
benefit in it.

5
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:25,672
And if she goes
somewhat too far
in the matter, …

6
00:00:25,672 --> 00:00:28,552
he guides her
in a good manner.

7
00:00:28,552 --> 00:00:30,856
Likewise the wife:

8
00:00:30,856 --> 00:00:34,086
When she sees
in her husband
zeal for what is good

9
00:00:34,856 --> 00:00:37,502
and commitment
to what is good, …

10
00:00:38,312 --> 00:00:42,718
she shows him
her joy about it

11
00:00:43,688 --> 00:00:45,956
and encourages him
in this matter –

12
00:00:45,956 --> 00:00:47,710
so life
becomes beautiful.

13
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:53,096
And both spouses
work together,
with each of them …

14
00:00:53,096 --> 00:00:57,100
… taking the other
by the hand –
towards what benefits.
